Interpretation guide:
  - The x-axis shows hypothetical correlation (rho) between residuals
  - At rho = 0, no unmeasured confounding (standard mediation estimate)
  - The rho where ACME crosses 0 is the critical sensitivity parameter
  - Larger |critical rho| = more robust to confounding
